{"t":"Whirlwind Throw","s":"whirlwind-throw-b4059","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Whirlwind_Throw_15cccd.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Whirlwind Throw</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Whirlwind Throw\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Whirlwind_Throw_15cccd.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori hur</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">40</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">28</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">32</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Throws the wielded weapon at the selected target like a boomerang, dealing <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">physical damage</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Cowardly creatures that run away from a fight can still be brought down by a knight with the Whirlwind Throw. Just like a boomerang, this spell lets the knight fling his weapon on his enemy and then returns it to his hand. Already young knights are able to learn this useful spell. However, a knight is well advised to train his weapon skill beforehand as the damage will rise with the skill to handle the weapon he is wielding. Moreover, he should carefully consider which weapon he uses to perform this spell, as this determines the damage type he is dealing out.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Has an attack range of 5 square meters. The animation will change depending on the weapon type you are wielding. It will look like throwing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Blacksteel%20Sword\">Blacksteel Sword</a> when wielding a sword, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Axe\">Royal Axe</a> when wielding an axe and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cranial%20Basher\">Cranial Basher</a> when wielding a club.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"05ee7ca2977128651fbd2e13d9ebf878\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Exori_hur-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:72px; width:185px; top:56.5px;\"><img alt=\"When wielding a sword\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"When wielding a sword\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exori_hur_872f7f.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Exori hur.jpg (16 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">When wielding a sword</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Exori_hur2-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px; top:24.5px;\"><img alt=\"When wielding an axe\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"When wielding an axe\" height=\"183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exori_hur2_969d0f.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Exori hur2.jpg (10 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">When wielding an axe</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-WhirlwindClub-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:161px;\"><img alt=\"When wielding a club\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"When wielding a club\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/WhirlwindClub_b02fc1.png\" style=\"\" title=\"WhirlwindClub.png (59 KB)\" width=\"163\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">When wielding a club</div></div></div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20180206145413&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Black_Knight_e0c0c6.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"500\" data-vert=\"500\" style=\"width:500%;height:500%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181005130207&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Throwing_Axe_Missile_27d959.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class